 "summary": "The new `frameTopology` on native metrics is defined as the topology induced through `toSymmetricSection` from the existing `ContMDiffSection.frameTopology`, and each result reuses an existing lemma (`frameTopology_eq_of_covers`, `t2Space_frameTopology`, `isTopologicalAddGroup_frameTopology`, `continuousSMul_frameTopology`, `positiveDefiniteSymmetricSectionEquiv`) without rebuilding it; I found no existing frame topology on metrics, no existing cone homeomorphism and no existing symmetric-section convex-combination lemma. The existing chart C\u1d4f topology and its `continuous_convexCombination` in Riemannian/Topology.lean and Interpolation.lean:242 work in a different setting (the tangent bundle, C^\u221e metrics, chart derivatives), so they do not replace this work.",
